    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are skilled at <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disarming\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disarming\">Disarming</a> opponents in melee combat.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> 13, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Melee_Defense\" title=\"Melee Defense\">Melee Defense</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You gain a +5 bonus on any melee attack roll made to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disarm\" title=\"Disarm\">Disarm</a> an opponent. In addition, if you fail to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disarm\" title=\"Disarm\">Disarm</a> an opponent, he doesn't get to make a free attack against you.</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Additional_Improved_Disarm_Effects\">Additional Improved Disarm Effects</span></h2><p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Combined_Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Combined Feat\">Combined Feat</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Training\" title=\"Force Training\">Force Training</a>):</b> When you use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Disarm\" title=\"Force Disarm\"><i>Force Disarm</i></a> Force Power, you gain the +5 bonus from Improved Disarm on your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check as though you were making an attack roll.</p>",
